#describe what Windows of the packaged Linux app get the Lantern icon from resources/icon.png, found by a pure lookup; macOS and Windows are unchanged.
#describe before A Linux window had no icon option, so the window and taskbar showed Electron's default.
#describe after On Linux the window icon is resources/icon.png when packaged and out/assets/appicon.png in dev; macOS and Windows get none.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, the new unit test and its mutation; the Linux package check asserts the icon. Not seen on a Linux desktop.
