#reason src/main/window-icon.ts Keeps the icon lookup a pure function of platform and paths so it can be tested.
#reason test/window-icon.test.ts Proves Linux gets the icon path and macOS and Windows get none.
#reason package.json Ships the app icon as a resource of the Linux package, which electron-packager ignores for --icon on Linux.
#reason scripts/check-linux-package.sh Fails the Linux package check when the window icon is missing from the zip.
#reason src/main/main.ts Resolves the Linux window icon once and hands it to the window and pop-out code.
#reason src/main/popout.ts Gives pop-out windows the Linux icon so the taskbar does not show Electron's default.
#reason src/main/windows.ts Gives workspace windows the Linux icon so the taskbar does not show Electron's default.
#story A Linux user sees Lantern's icon on its windows
#step actor Linux user
#step action opens a Lantern window on
#step subject the packaged Linux app
